  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improvement of Health Services</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Mejoramiento Servicios Salud</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROGRAM&apos;S OBJECTIVE IS TO IMPROVE THE PERFORMANCE AND ADMINISTRATION OF HEALTH INSTITUTIONS IN THE MANAGEMENT AND USE OF RESOURCES; TO PROVIDE FOR A MORE RATIONAL USE OF HOSPITAL INFRASTRUCTURE AND CAPABILITIES; TO PROVIDE TRAINING TO HOSPITAL ADMINISTRATORS AT BOTH CENTRALIZED AND DECENTRALIZED LEVELS IN HOSPITAL PERFORMANCE AND ADMINISTRATION FOR SELECTED HOSPITALS. A PREINVESTMENT COMPONENT WILL PREPARE PROJECTS FOR WIDE SECTORAL APPLICATION.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
